  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Andean Highways</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Pasos Fronterizos y Corredores de Integracin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO IMPROVE ROAD TRANSPORT BETWEEN ARGENTINA AND CHILE AND REDUCE RISKS AND DELAYS THAT USERS ARE SUBJECTED DURING WINTER SEASON. THE PROGRAM CONTEMPLATES ROADWAY IMPROVEMENTS ON THE ARGENTINIAN SIDE OFMOST IMPORTANT ROADS CONNECTING WITH CHILE, AS WELL AS THE DEPLOYMENT OF MAINTENANCE AND ROAD OPERATION SYSTEMS THAT WILL REDUCE ROAD CLOSURES AND WILL PROVIDE GREATER SAFETY CONDITIONS TO THE USERS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
